              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "This endpoint works faster and requires fewer credits as it is not using AI-powered layout analysis, OCR support, and also has no support for profiles for fine-tuning. For advanced conversion with layout analysis, OCR (for scanned pages), PDF repair, and other features please use the [PDF to Text](/api-reference/pdf-to-text) endpoint instead."
